            "created_at": "2025-07-10T00:09:14.119346+00:00",
            "notes": "[The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) fills the role of  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) since you can provide quick healing to one target while also having the flexibility to damage boost while pocketing someone or healing two people at once.\n\n [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) is strongest when pocketing as you can hold damage boost then heal the chip damage your target may be taking.\n\n [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  to scale Whambulance.\n\n [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for stronger healing early game as helps make Sympathetic Recovery heal a bit more.\n\n [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for more survivability. You should always be taking  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) over  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) since you will be regenning constantly from your passive so the adamage reduction armor gives is much more valuable.\n\nFor now look to using Bunnyhops in order to get the shortest GA cooldown. You can use slingshot to get distance from teammates for better  [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) procs but this will give you a longer cooldown.",
