            "notes": "ALWAYS RUSH  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)  FIRST. \n\nThis item is necessary to make [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) viable and not as clunky to use since you can slingshot and get your GA back quicker. This also allows you to not buy as much Cooldown Reduction saving cruicial item slots for more AP. When you get this item always look to slingshot as slingshotting will give the shortest GA cooldown allowing you to spam  [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) more.\n\nBe open to selling  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) if necessary.\n \nIf you are very poor and can't purchase  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) then stack AP items like   [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) and  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)",
