            "notes": "[Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb)  is a huge power spike for Mercy and is generally a great power for her. Be mindful that the beams connected can mess up  [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) if you use Prefer Facing Target or Prefer Beam Target so do make sure to aim where you want your healing to go. If you are going against a lot of healing reduction from characters like  [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed)  then take [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) to help mitigate some of it.\n\nUsually I try to make sure I can buy  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)  at the minimum for early AP. For extra cash look to buy  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for AP and Cooldown Reduction. If you can not purchase  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and are on a more open map like Redwood Dam or Illios Ruins then take  [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) as the extra GA range can help you reach teammates better. If the map is more closed/shorter such as Place Lacroix and Throne of Anubis then take  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) as the extra stats in AP and Weapon will be much more valuable to help charge ult quicker.\n\nUse any leftover cash after buying recommended items to fill item slots with more AP or survivability.",
