            "notes": "Edit 7/9/2025\nRecently I've been gravitating more towards  [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) as it will make rezzes in Valk much safer and since we're buying AP it will provide a lot of overhealth to you and your teammate. If you took  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) in Round 3 then take  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) .  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) can still be chosen in Round 5 but is very team comp dependent as if you aren't able to rez then you have a dead power.\n\nLook to buy  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) at the minimum but if you have extra cash then look to get  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for more AP and Cooldown reduction or  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) for raw AP stats.",
