            "created_at": "2025-07-10T00:09:14.119346+00:00",
            "notes": "If you feel that your healing with  [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) is enough then take  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) to put more power into your damage boost.\n\nIf you need more AP then you can look to take  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) or  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) if you can afford them.\n\nOtherwise take any assortment of AP items listed below.\n\nOnly take  [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) on longer maps like Redwood Dam, if it is a short map then take   [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) .",
