            "created_at": "2025-07-10T00:09:14.119346+00:00",
            "notes": "The build shown is MAX Build. You may not always hit this but you should try to at least have the 5 epic items at the minimum. \n\nThe power you choose can be flexible to what you need the most. \n [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1) to give more power to damage boost or   [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) for more power in Rez, usually I take this if I took  [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) , or  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) for more healing.\n\nMost of the other powers rely on healing from Caduceus Staff like [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) ,  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) ,  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) , and  [Glass Extra Full](item_659ff350-8602-42cd-b5f9-f4da7e5e912b) tend to not synergize well since we are not building for beam.\n\n\n\nLook to purchase  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) and sell  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) . If you have enough to replace  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) then take  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for more cooldown reduction and an extra effect. If you can not buy  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) then you can take  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) to potentially get more AP at 25% if you have all stacks or keep Nano Cola for a consistent 20% AP.",
